# Used by the app and execution-engine images, which build from the repo root so Maven
# can see the parent pom and the messaging module. Allowlist only what they need, so
# .env, .git and other modules never end up in the build context.
*
!pom.xml
!messaging/pom.xml
!messaging/src
!app/pom.xml
!app/src
!execution-engine/pom.xml
!execution-engine/src
